sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Manager Client
    participant G as Managers API (Gateway)
    participant C as ManagerMetricsController
    participant R as Redis Cache
    participant A as Aggregation Service
    participant D as Directory Repository
    participant S as Session Repository
    participant MR as Metrics Repository

    Note over M,C: Compute org KPIs: total users, active users, total sessions\nQuery params include time-range: from,to

    M->>G: GET /orgs/{orgId}/metrics?from=&to=
    G->>C: Forward request with orgId and time-range

    C->>R: GET cache[orgId, from, to]
    alt Cache hit
        R-->>C: cached metrics
        C-->>G: 200 OK + metrics
        G-->>M: 200 OK + metrics
    else Cache miss
        par Compute user counts
            C->>A: getOrgUserCounts(orgId, from, to)
            A->>D: countUsers(orgId)
            D-->>A: totalUsers
            A->>S: countActiveUsers(orgId, from, to)
            S-->>A: activeUsers
            A-->>C: {totalUsers, activeUsers}
        and Compute total sessions
            C->>MR: getPreAggregatedSessions(orgId, from, to)
            alt Pre-aggregated available
                MR-->>C: totalSessions
            else Not available
                C->>S: countSessions(orgId, from, to)
                S-->>C: totalSessions
            end
        end

        C->>R: SET cache[orgId, from, to] = metrics TTL=15m
        C-->>G: 200 OK + metrics
        G-->>M: 200 OK + metrics
    end
